# Golden recording of the original Ananas, profile address-offset.
# Setup: Use Address Offset on. Unit id filter off, all registers zero before the run.
# Recorded 2026-10-15 with: ananasar-parity run <host:port> --profile address-offset
# Notes start with '#!', see crates/ananasar-parity/src/golden.rs.
#! default-deviation: Ananasar does not implement this option yet, so it answers like the default setup (issues 88, 89, 90)


